{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You click a dog. It gives you bones. Some of them smell weird.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the world\u2019s most serious game about digging up increasingly bizarre bones. Click the dog. Upgrade your bone-finding tech. Get a <strong>Bone Radar</strong>. Discover a <strong>rainbow bone</strong>, a <strong>lizard bone</strong>, even a <strong>Bon Jovi bone</strong>. Why? We don't know. But you need them. All of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your dog digs bones <strong>while you\u2019re away</strong>. Wake up to a pile of bones and wonder what your life has become. Trade bones. Hoard bones. Worship bones?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dog clicking (obviously)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bones with rarities and questionable origins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auto-digging upgrades with nonsense names</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline drops, Steam Cloud, and achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A bone inventory bigger than your actual problems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s stupid. It\u2019s genius. It\u2019s <strong>Digging Dogs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Ruff Beginnings","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836520/d6a22861611ca18f9605030458f957fde46fe6ab.jpg"},{"name":"Tail-Wag Worthy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836520/d2971d85a337b22a02f56624eeec8f7f15bee556.jpg"},{"name":"Howl You Found That","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3836520/8bc9d77360198a6a0db6e9d6c2ca6d1a7e5c1d32.jpg"},{"name":"Bone Believer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/pu